  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 727a75301c3d24613a3ebcec4a24c2c8, type: 3}
  title: XR Starter Project
  sections:
  - heading: Start Here
    text: Open XR Starter > Start Here for the first-run lab checklist. Start in Assets/_Project/Scenes/SampleScene.unity, then save your own scene before making changes.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Work in _Project
    text: Put your scenes, scripts, prefabs, art, audio, and UI in Assets/_Project. Leave Assets/Samples, Assets/ThirdParty, and XR settings unchanged unless an assignment says otherwise.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Test before headset builds
    text: Use the XR Interaction Simulator in Play Mode to verify interactions. When your scene is ready, add it to File > Build Profiles before testing on device.
    linkText:
    url:
  - heading: Package samples
    text: This template uses XRI 3.5.1. Controller and simulator samples are included; hand-tracking demos are intentionally omitted. Choose XR Starter > Validate Template Setup before using a package sample as reference.
    linkText:
    url:
  loadedLayout: 1
